OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal for information
OL,4,Aafter woman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for witnesses and
OL,7,Finformation following the unexpected
OL,8,Fdeath of a woman.
OL,10,FKelsey Smith, 36, was found
OL,11,Funresponsive at a house in Ashby Road
OL,12,Fin Watford, on 28 September.
OL,14,FDetectives were called by the ambulance
OL,15,Fservice at around 01:40 BST after
OL,16,Fconcerns were raised for her welfare.
OL,18,FShe was taken to hospital, where she
OL,19,Fdied a short time later.
